  "limitations": [
    "A small targeted corpus with three repetitions per case and two new held-out cases. No general statistical guarantee is inferred.",
    "Primary scoring stops at the decision after review and, for approve, a fresh verifier. Worker repair cycles are outside the measured cost.",
    "Routing checks are native reviewer calls with controlled routing contexts, including one explicitly synthetic prior verifier summary. They are not 27 complete CLI workflows.",
    "Blocked prevents approval when a necessary execution check has no guaranteed immediate required verifier. It does not establish that a defect exists.",
    "Elapsed seconds are summed per call and are not wall-clock completion time. Reasoning/cache tokens are reported separately and monetary costs are unavailable.",
    "V3 is exploratory after post-hoc adjudication. V4 was stopped because its full engine archive exposed previous answer summaries. Neither is included in this primary comparison."
  ]
